{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\\left(\\sqrt[4]{d}\\right)^3\u0026=\\left(d^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac14}}\\right)^3\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=d^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac14\\footnotesize\\cdot 3}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\left(d^3\\right)^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac14}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\sqrt[4]{d^{3}}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo $\\left(d^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{4}}}\\right)^3$ and $\\sqrt[4]{d^{3}}$ are both correct.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\\sqrt[3]{d^4}\u0026=\\left(d^4\\right)^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac13}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=d^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac13\\cdot 4}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\left(d^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac13}}\\right)^4\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\left(\\sqrt[3]{d}\\right)^4\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026\\neq \\left(\\sqrt[4]{d}\\right)^3\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo $\\sqrt[3]{d^4}$ isn't correct.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, these are the correct answers:\n\n- $\\left(d^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{4}}}\\right)^3$\n- $\\sqrt[4]{d^{3}}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Which expressions are equivalent to $\\left(\\sqrt[4]{d}\\right)^3$ ?**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\left(d^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{4}}}\\right)^3$","correct":true},{"content":"$\\sqrt[4]{d^{3}}$","correct":true},{"content":"$\\sqrt[3]{d^4}$","isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":true},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
